  "id": "manualized-therapy",
  "term": "manualized therapy",
  "definition": "Manualized therapy is treatment that is delivered using a structured therapy manual rather than being planned entirely ad hoc. In this context, it refers to psychotherapists providing a standardized form of treatment based on a specified intervention approach.",
